'''Imperial Forward Field Operations''', also called '''Camp Forward''', was a temporary headquarters for the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[224th Imperial Armored Division|forces]] located deep in the [[disputed wilderness zone]] on the [[swamp]] [[planet]] [[Mimban]], where combat against the [[Mimbanese Liberation Army]] was the strongest during the [[Mimban Campaign]]. [[Imperial Military|Military]] support of [[All Terrain Defense Turret|AT-DTs]], [[TIE/ln space superiority starfighter|TIE fighters]], and [[Y-45 armored transport hauler|AT-haulers]] originated from Camp Forward, and the base featured an [[Camp Forward airfield|airfield]], [[Imperial Mobile Surgical Unit|mobile surgical units]], and rows of tents.<ref name="TOG" />

